# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002503> (towards)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002503> "q towards e2 if and only if q is a relational quality such that q inheres-in some e, and e != e2 and q is dependent on e2")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002503> "This relation is provided in order to support the use of relational qualities such as 'concentration of'; for example, the concentration of C in V is a quality that inheres in V, but pertains to C.")
